{
  "version": 1,
  "updated": "2026-10",
  "note": "Model -> factory GPU options. `match` patterns are case-insensitive regexes tested against Model, SystemFamily, product Version/Name and SKU. ThinkPads report the 4-char machine type (4282AC5) in Win32_ComputerSystem.Model, so the prefixes matter. dgpu_standard=true means every SKU shipped with a discrete GPU, so its absence is a real red flag.",
